Example query to get the 10 users with the largest token + staked token balances (can be run on the deployed subgraph above):


```
{
  users(first:10, orderBy:votingPower, orderDirection:desc) {
    id
    totalRewardsClaimed
    totalTokens
    totalStakedTokens
    votingPower
  }
}
```

Had to use `votingPower` to store the sum of a user's token and staked token balance since I couldn't find out how to sort by the sum of fields with graphQL 😞
